From 8702f00ccea49d72232013feb4008411076ef033 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Waleed <waleedhamadallah@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 07:29:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix undo-toast unclickability, water bidi reversal,
 sync/reminder refresh gaps, and wire native plugin build files

- css/js: fix #toast.show missing pointer-events (undo button was never
  actually clickable), undo restoring meals to the wrong day, RTL bidi
  reversal on the water counter, stale select dropdowns (nfCat/recipeCat),
  small quick-add tap target, missing template delete icon, and a stale
  weight/calorie trend chart after saving a weigh-in
- core.js/progress.js: refresh the home-screen widget and reminder schedule
  after every cloud-sync pull and backup restore, not just on app init
- sw.js: don't cache failed HTTP responses over the last good cached copy
- android: regenerate capacitor.plugins.json / capacitor.settings.gradle /
  capacitor.build.gradle via `cap sync` so @capacitor/app and
  @capacitor/local-notifications are actually linked into the native build;
  add the missing ic_stat_icon notification drawable
- server/ai-proxy-worker.js: add this file to the repo (was only living on
  Cloudflare), guard against a null JSON body, translate the last English
  error string
- package-lock.json: back in sync with package.json

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
